 returned with empty settings and styles. Only works for posts that were saved with Elementor.','The provided tag is not an allowed HTML wrapper tag.'=>'The provided tag is not an allowed HTML wrapper tag.','A tag is required.'=>'A tag is required.','Returns the active kit\'s site-wide default styles for a single HTML wrapper tag (h1..h6, p, a, section, div, button, ...) as a raw CSS string. Includes selectors, @media(--breakpoint) blocks, and &:hover/&:focus/&:active pseudo-states as the frontend renders them. Widget-specific base styles are NOT included — this is only the kit\'s site-wide default layer.'=>'Returns the active kit\'s site-wide default styles for a single HTML wrapper tag (h1..h6, p, a, section, div, button, ...) as a raw CSS string. Includes selectors, @media(--breakpoint) blocks, and &:hover/&:focus/&:active pseudo-states as the front end renders them. Widget-specific base styles are NOT included — this is only the kit\'s site-wide default layer.','Get Default Styles'=>'Get Default Styles','Could not create a revision snapshot for this post.'=>'Could not create a revision snapshot for this post.','Sorry, you are not allowed to share a preview of this post.'=>'Sorry, you are not allowed to share a preview of this post.','Create Elementor Public Preview Link'=>'Create Elementor Public Preview Link','Page created.'=>'Page created.','Duplicate configuration-id "%s". Each element must have a unique configuration-id.'=>'Duplicate configuration-id "%s". Each element must have a unique configuration-id.','Failed to parse xml_structure: %s'=>'Failed to parse xml_structure: %s','"%1$s" requires a direct child "%2$s".'=>'"%1$s" requires a direct child "%2$s".','"%1$s" is not allowed as a child of "%2$s". Allowed: %3$s.'=>'"%1$s" is not allowed as a child of "%2$s". Allowed: %3$s.','"%1$s" is a leaf widget and cannot have children. "%2$s" is not allowed as a child of "%1$s".'=>'"%1$s" is a leaf widget and cannot have children. "%2$s" is not allowed as a child 